Diagnostic used to catch the out-of-bounds symbol read in the act.

Apply to bfd/elf32-microblaze.c of binutils-gdb-7af075d with the 13 meta-xilinx
rel-v2021.1 patches applied, rebuild ld, and relink any large MicroBlaze image
with -relax (the gcc default) and --gc-sections.  Every line printed is an
out-of-bounds read of the local-symbol cache; the ones marked
"GUARD PASSED - CORRUPTING" with a non-zero fixup are relocations whose addend
was silently damaged.

